#!/bin/sh
# pppoemanager-ipdown — commit final session bytes to meta at PPP disconnect
LOG="/tmp/ppoemanager-ipdown.log"
exec >> "$LOG" 2>&1
echo "=== $(date) ==="
echo "ARGS: $*"

IFACE="$1"
[ -z "$IFACE" ] && { echo "no iface"; exit 0; }

SESSION_FILE="/lib/ppp/ppoemanager-session"
META_FILE="/lib/ppp/ppoemanager-meta"
TMP_SESS="/lib/ppp/ppoemanager-session.tmp"
TMP_META="/lib/ppp/ppoemanager-meta.tmp"

[ ! -f "$SESSION_FILE" ] && { echo "no session file"; exit 0; }
[ ! -f "$META_FILE" ] && { echo "no meta file"; exit 0; }

ENTRY=$(grep "|$IFACE|" "$SESSION_FILE" | head -1)
[ -z "$ENTRY" ] && { echo "no entry for $IFACE"; exit 0; }

USER=$(echo "$ENTRY" | cut -d'|' -f4)
RX_BASE=$(echo "$ENTRY" | cut -d'|' -f5)
TX_BASE=$(echo "$ENTRY" | cut -d'|' -f6)
RX_LAST=$(echo "$ENTRY" | cut -d'|' -f7)
TX_LAST=$(echo "$ENTRY" | cut -d'|' -f8)

[ -z "$USER" ] && { echo "no user"; exit 0; }
[ -z "$RX_BASE" ] && RX_BASE=0
[ -z "$TX_BASE" ] && TX_BASE=0

# Try to read sysfs first (interface may still exist)
RX_FINAL=$(cat /sys/class/net/$IFACE/statistics/rx_bytes 2>/dev/null)
TX_FINAL=$(cat /sys/class/net/$IFACE/statistics/tx_bytes 2>/dev/null)
echo "sysfs rx=$RX_FINAL tx=$TX_FINAL"

# If sysfs is gone, fall back to session file's last checker-observed values
if [ -z "$RX_FINAL" ] || [ -z "$TX_FINAL" ]; then
    echo "sysfs empty, using fallback rx_last=$RX_LAST tx_last=$TX_LAST"
    RX_FINAL="$RX_LAST"
    TX_FINAL="$TX_LAST"
fi

[ -z "$RX_FINAL" ] && RX_FINAL=0
[ -z "$TX_FINAL" ] && TX_FINAL=0

DELTA_RX=$((RX_FINAL - RX_BASE))
DELTA_TX=$((TX_FINAL - TX_BASE))
[ $DELTA_RX -lt 0 ] && DELTA_RX=0
[ $DELTA_TX -lt 0 ] && DELTA_TX=0
echo "user=$USER delta rx=$DELTA_RX tx=$DELTA_TX"

awk -F'|' -v u="$USER" -v drx="$DELTA_RX" -v dtx="$DELTA_TX" -v OFS='|' '
    {
        if ($1 == u && NF >= 10) {
            $9 = ($9 == "" ? 0 : $9) + drx
            $10 = ($10 == "" ? 0 : $10) + dtx
        }
        print
    }
' "$META_FILE" > "$TMP_META" && mv "$TMP_META" "$META_FILE"
echo "meta committed"

grep -v "|$IFACE|" "$SESSION_FILE" > "$TMP_SESS" 2>/dev/null && mv "$TMP_SESS" "$SESSION_FILE"
echo "session entry removed"
exit 0
